      "## Phase One: Identify Opportunities and Prioritise Them",
      "Create a list of potential processes and evaluate each one according to frequency, time consumed, error rate, data sensitivity, and ease of integration with existing systems. You do not need to begin with the most complex project. In many cases, the best starting point is the project that can deliver a clear result quickly while keeping risks manageable.",
      "## Phase Two: Design a Measurable Pilot",
