      "For decoration, embroidery communicates permanence and survives industrial washing, so it belongs on uniforms and caps. Screen printing is economical for large single-colour runs. DTF and transfer methods handle detailed, multi-colour artwork on small quantities. The right choice depends on wash frequency, quantity and how much detail the logo genuinely needs at chest size.",
